flowchart LR
    Customer[Customer web/mobile client]
    Attacker[External attacker]
    subgraph Public[Trust boundary A: public ingress]
      Gateway[HTTPS API gateway / WAF]
    end
    subgraph Internal[Trust boundary B: private service network]
      Auth[Identity provider / session validator]
      Account[Accounts service]
      Transfer[Transfer service]
    end
    subgraph Persistence[Trust boundary C: trusted data and evidence]
      Ledger[(Accounts / double-entry ledger)]
      Outbox[(Audit event outbox)]
      Audit[Append-only audit sink]
    end
    Customer -->|1 Login/read/transfer via TLS| Gateway
    Attacker -.->|2 Untrusted API input| Gateway
    Gateway -->|3 Validate identity| Auth
    Gateway -->|4 Authenticated query| Account
    Gateway -->|5 Authenticated command| Transfer
    Account -->|6 Ownership-scoped read| Ledger
    Transfer -->|7 Locked atomic posting| Ledger
    Transfer -->|8 Audit in same transaction| Outbox
    Outbox -->|9 Durable asynchronous delivery| Audit
